WEBVTT

00:00:07.612 --> 00:00:09.272
<v><b>A:</b></v> Have you finished the washing up?

00:00:09.892 --> 00:00:10.517
<v><b>B:</b></v> Not yet.

00:00:12.092 --> 00:00:13.400
<v><b>A:</b></v> Have you started it?

00:00:15.631 --> 00:00:17.420
<v><b>B:</b></v> Er…yes.

00:00:18.348 --> 00:00:23.776
<v><b>A:</b></v> What’s that noise? Have you broken something?

00:00:26.819 --> 00:00:32.262
<v><b>B:</b></v> No… Well, only a glass.

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:54.660
<v><b>A:</b></v> Hey!

00:00:58.707 --> 00:01:03.044
<v><b>B:</b></v> Hey! What’s for dinner?

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:03.722
<v><b>A:</b></v> I don’t know.

00:01:04.896 --> 00:01:05.863
I haven’t made anything.

00:01:06.726 --> 00:01:07.974
I’ve just got home.

00:01:08.608 --> 00:01:12.946
<v><b>B:</b></v> From the gym! Is there anything in the fridge?

00:01:13.216 --> 00:01:14.883
<v><b>A:</b></v> Nothing much.

00:01:15.354 --> 00:01:17.472
I haven’t been to the supermarket yet.

00:01:18.091 --> 00:01:18.677
<v><b>B:</b></v> Oh!

00:01:19.547 --> 00:01:21.744
<v><b>A:</b></v> Maybe you can go?

00:01:32.477 --> 00:01:34.133
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you going to take the rubbish out?

00:01:35.509 --> 00:01:36.480
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’ve already done it.

00:01:37.168 --> 00:01:38.964
<v><b>A:</b></v> And have you put a new bag in the bin?

00:01:39.397 --> 00:01:41.040
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I couldn’t find one.

00:01:41.604 --> 00:01:42.548
Where did you put them?

00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:45.659
<v><b>A:</b></v> In the usual place!